@@ -3,6 +3,13 @@
 History
 -------
 
+Unreleased
+++++++++++
+
+- If a job raises in ``run_pending()`` / ``run_all()``, the remaining jobs now run
+  before the first exception is re-raised. Failed jobs are rescheduled.
+  ``run_all()`` only sleeps between jobs.
+
 1.2.2 (2024-05-25)
 ++++++++++++++++++
 
